MacBreeze is a modified version of RPMac (https://github.com/golirt1/RPMAC),
Copyright (C) 2026 golirt1. Changes: new name and icon, German user interface,
five looks with round RPM gauges, system monitor, tray hover info, resizable
window, menu bar position, UAC-free admin launcher, T2 fixes (stale
"SMC not responding" flag, PawnIO setup helper and clearer error messages).

